5
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:12,981
答案是一个编排器
The answer is an orchestrator.

6
00:00:13,301 --> 00:00:16,949
课上用的是 Vertex AI Pipelines，基于 Kubeflow
The lecture uses Vertex AI Pipelines, on Kubeflow.

7
00:00:17,269 --> 00:00:20,022
这个教程用的是 SageMaker Pipelines
This tutorial uses SageMaker Pipelines,

8
00:00:20,022 --> 00:00:22,987
同样是把托管的步骤放进一张图里
the same idea of managed steps in a graph.

9
