With keys, it builds in 40 seconds and opens a root shell. Two notes.

42
00:02:23,911 --> 00:02:28,690
这个脚本为 amd64 构建，Apple Silicon 上要模拟运行
This script builds for amd64, which Apple silicon emulates.

43
