在 Ubuntu 或 Debian 上，sh 就是 dash
And on Ubuntu or Debian, sh is dash,

44
00:02:31,981 --> 00:02:36,520
它会跳过密钥检查，所以要跑 bash docker-shell.sh
which skips the key check, so run bash docker-shell.sh.

45
00:02:36,767 --> 00:02:37,997
为什么是一个 shell？
Why a shell?

46
00:02:38,047 --> 00:02:40,074
这个 entrypoint 脚本里有一个开关
The entry point script has a switch.

47
00:02:40,394 --> 00:02:44,682
没有参数：它就打开 bash，也就是开发模式，你现在就在这里
No arguments: it opens bash, development mode, where you are now.

48
00:02:45,002 --> 00:02:48,330
有参数：它就运行它们然后退出，也就是生产模式
Arguments: it runs them and exits, production mode.

49
00:02:48,650 --> 00:02:51,146
课上把这叫作可调用的 container
The lecture calls that a callable container.

50
00:02:51,384 --> 00:02:55,331
第 2 步：search 命令，四种奶酪，每种十张图片
Step 2: the search command, four cheeses, ten images each.

51
