finds none among these 40, and the upload of clean.zip fails.

62
00:03:33,413 --> 00:03:34,750
暂停一下，跑一遍
Pause and run it.

63
00:03:34,800 --> 00:03:38,555
第 3 步和第 4 步：检查你的 bucket，然后 --prepare
Steps 3 and 4: check your bucket, then --prepare.

64
00:03:38,875 --> 00:03:44,180
40 张图片全部划分成 32 张训练、8 张验证
All 40 images split into 32 for training and 8 for validation,

65
00:03:44,180 --> 00:03:46,491
写进两个真实的 TFRecord 文件
in two real TFRecord files.

66
00:03:46,811 --> 00:03:48,411
上传又失败了
The upload fails again.

67
00:03:48,624 --> 00:03:50,950
第 5 步只能在磁盘上找到它们
Step 5 finds them only on disk.

68
00:03:51,434 --> 00:03:54,100
课上的职责卡片都对得上
The duty cards from the lecture match:

69
00:03:54,100 --> 00:03:58,730
下载，然后验证、去重、转成 TFRecords
download, then verify, remove duplicates and convert to TFRecords.

70
00:03:59,050 --> 00:04:03,032
四个 label 就是目录名，也就是你的搜索词
And the four labels are just the folder names: your search queries,

71
00:04:03,032 --> 00:04:04,632
所以要一字不差地输入
so type them exactly.

72
00:04:06,833 --> 00:04:08,604
模型训练，第 1 步
Model training, step 1.

73
00:04:08,924 --> 00:04:11,782
同样是 arm64 那一行，同样对调
Same arm64 line, same swap.

74
