这个 image 用 commit 过的 lock 文件安装
This image installs from its committed lock,

75
00:04:15,098 --> 00:04:18,161
用的是 SageMaker 版本 2，所以不需要 pin
with SageMaker version 2, so it needs no pin.

76
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:20,149
第 2 步，本地训练
Step 2, local training.

77
00:04:20,469 --> 00:04:25,688
CPU 上的 TensorFlow 2.20 找到了处理器的 TFRecords
TensorFlow 2.20 on the CPU finds the TFRecords from the processor,

78
00:04:25,688 --> 00:04:27,744
通过共享目录
through the shared folder.

79
00:04:28,064 --> 00:04:30,432
看最后一层：三个输出
Look at the last layer: three outputs.

80
00:04:30,752 --> 00:04:32,259
跑了一个 epoch
One epoch runs.

81
00:04:32,309 --> 00:04:34,314
它的准确率现在还说明不了什么
Its accuracy means nothing yet.

82
00:04:34,550 --> 00:04:39,009
然后保存失败了：Permission denied，/persistent/model
Then saving fails: Permission denied, /persistent/model.

83
00:04:39,329 --> 00:04:41,334
在这里暂停一下，做两处小修复
Pause here for two small fixes.

84
00:04:41,583 --> 00:04:44,033
第一处，第 68 行写的是三个类别
First, line 68 says three classes,

85
00:04:44,033 --> 00:04:48,068
可数据有四个 label，所以 gouda 没有对应的目标
while the data has four labels, so gouda gets no target.

86
00:04:48,388 --> 00:04:49,833
把它改成 4
Change it to 4.

87
00:04:49,883 --> 00:04:51,525
第二处，在 Linux 上
Second, on Linux, Docker

88
00:04:51,525 --> 00:04:54,124
Docker 以 root 身份创建了 persistent 目录
created the persistent folder as root,

89
00:04:54,124 --> 00:04:56,859
而这个 container 以 app 用户运行
and this container runs as the app user.

90
00:04:57,179 --> 00:05:01,766
退出，在你的笔记本上改它的所有者，用卡片上的那条命令
Exit, and on your laptop change its owner with the chown command on the card.

91
00:05:02,086 --> 00:05:03,586
如果是全新 clone 的 repo
On a fresh clone,

92
00:05:03,586 --> 00:05:07,334
在第一次跑 docker-shell.sh 之前，自己创建这个目录
create the folder yourself before the first docker-shell.sh.

93
00:05:07,654 --> 00:05:09,254
然后再跑一次第 2 步
Then run step 2 again.

94
00:05:09,531 --> 00:05:12,006
Mac 上的 Docker Desktop 不会遇到这个问题
Docker Desktop on a Mac avoids this.

95
00:05:12,250 --> 00:05:15,123
它会写到 /persistent/model/1
It would write to /persistent/model/1:

96
00:05:15,123 --> 00:05:17,920
也就是你笔记本上的 persistent 目录
the persistent folder on your laptop,

