00:05:17,920 --> 00:05:21,850
或者训练任务里 SageMaker 的模型目录
or the SageMaker model folder inside a training job.

98
00:05:22,100 --> 00:05:26,428
就在保存之前，是课上讲的签名变化
Just before the save sits the signature change from the lecture:

99
00:05:26,428 --> 00:05:29,268
解码、转换、缩放，都放在模型里
decode, convert, resize, inside the model.

100
00:05:29,588 --> 00:05:33,385
有一个小疏漏：README 把这件事交给了模型部署
A small slip: the README gives this job to model deploy.

101
00:05:33,705 --> 00:05:35,777
其实是训练脚本做的。第 3 步
The trainer does it. Step 3:

102
00:05:35,777 --> 00:05:41,301
sh package-trainer.sh 把 package 目录打包，再拷到 S3
sh package-trainer.sh packs the package folder and copies it to S3.

103
00:05:41,621 --> 00:05:43,221
这个 tar 文件是真的
The tar file is real.

104
00:05:43,499 --> 00:05:45,461
上传因为我们的假密钥失败了
The upload fails on our fake key.

105
00:05:45,700 --> 00:05:49,220
第 4 步：python cli.py --train
Step 4: python cli.py --train.

106
00:05:49,540 --> 00:05:54,233
它问 AWS 你是谁，用来拼出角色的 ARN，然后就停在那里
It asks AWS who you are, to build the role ARN, and stops there.

107
00:05:54,553 --> 00:05:57,519
有密钥时，它会启动一个训练任务
With keys, it starts a training job

108
00:05:57,519 --> 00:06:00,654
跑在 ml.m5.xlarge 上，并且马上返回
on ml.m5.xlarge, and returns at once.

109
00:06:00,900 --> 00:06:05,444
第 5 步：在控制台里看，Training 下面的 Training jobs
Step 5: watch it in the console, under Training, then Training jobs.

110
00:06:05,764 --> 00:06:07,406
它的名字以 cheese 开头
Its name starts with cheese.

111
00:06:08,750 --> 00:06:10,087
构建并 push
Build and push.

112
00:06:10,137 --> 00:06:13,081
README 说这一步已经替你做好了
The README says this step has already been done for you.

113
00:06:13,401 --> 00:06:16,553
有一个小疏漏：workflow 代码拉取的两个 image
A small gap: the workflow code pulls both images

114
00:06:16,553 --> 00:06:21,806
来自你自己账号的 ECR registry，所以你得自己 push，每个一次
from the ECR registry of your own account, so you push them yourself, once each.

115
00:06:22,050 --> 00:06:26,285
这正是课上为自己的 container 列的第二步
That is the second step the lecture gives for your own containers:

116
00:06:26,285 --> 00:06:29,943
把 image push 到平台能拉取的 registry
push the images to a registry the platform can pull from.

117
00:06:30,183 --> 00:06:34,279
第 1 到第 3 步走 Docker Hub：登录、构建、push
Steps 1 to 3 go through Docker Hub: log in, build, push.

118
00:06:34,599 --> 00:06:39,186
Mac 那一行构建 amd64，因为 SageMaker 跑的就是它
The Mac line builds amd64, because SageMaker runs that.

119
00:06:39,833 --> 00:06:41,838
第 4 步设置五个变量
Step 4 sets five variables.

120
00:06:42,158 --> 00:06:45,901
照原样贴进去，第一行会打印两个报错
Pasted exactly as written, the first line prints two errors,

121
00:06:45,901 --> 00:06:50,393
因为 export 不接受那段方括号注释，不过区域还是设上了
because export rejects the bracket note, though the region is still set.

122
00:06:50,713 --> 00:06:55,215
账号查询因为我们的假密钥失败了，URI 就以一个点开头
The account lookup fails on our fake key, and the URI starts with a dot.

123
00:06:55,450 --> 00:06:58,117
所以只贴值：us-east-1
So paste only the value, us-east-1.

124
00:06:58,437 --> 00:07:03,813
如果你的 URI 以点开头，就说明账号查询失败了：先修好你的密钥
And if your URI starts with a dot, the account lookup failed: fix your keys first.

125
00:07:04,050 --> 00:07:05,799
第 5 步拉取你的 image
Step 5 pulls your image.

126
00:07:06,119 --> 00:07:11,366
第 6 步创建仓库，结尾的 || true 把报错藏起来了
Step 6 creates the repository, and the || true at the end hides the error:

127
00:07:11,366 --> 00:07:13,351
命令以 0 退出
the command exits with zero.

128
00:07:13,600 --> 00:07:16,526
第 7 到第 11 步：让 Docker 登录 ECR
Steps 7 to 11 log Docker in to ECR,

129
