给 image 打 tag，push，列出来，再打印 URI
tag the image, push it, list it, and print the URI.

130
00:07:21,109 --> 00:07:24,117
打 tag 只是给同一个 image 加第二个名字
Tag only adds a second name to the same image.

131
00:07:24,437 --> 00:07:27,745
在你的笔记本上跑，别在 workflow container 里
Run them on your laptop, not in the workflow container,

132
00:07:27,745 --> 00:07:29,429
那里没有 docker 命令
which has no docker command.

133
00:07:29,749 --> 00:07:31,819
然后对数据处理器的 image 再做一遍
