134
00:07:35,833 --> 00:07:39,673
自动化数据采集器，第 1 步，在 workflow 目录里
Automate the data collector, step 1, in the workflow folder.

135
00:07:39,993 --> 00:07:44,729
在你跑 sh docker-shell.sh 之前，星号的问题又回来了
Before you run sh docker-shell.sh, the "*" problem returns.

136
00:07:45,049 --> 00:07:46,683
虽然 commit 了一个 lock 文件
A lock is committed,

137
00:07:46,683 --> 00:07:51,748
可 Dockerfile 只复制 Pipfile，所以构建会解析出版本 3
but the Dockerfile copies only the Pipfile, so the build would resolve version 3.

138
00:07:51,983 --> 00:07:53,903
检查结果显示导入失败了
The checks show the imports failing.

139
00:07:54,223 --> 00:07:57,060
所以先做同样的修复：小于 3
So make the same fix first: "<3".

140
00:08:03,116 --> 00:08:05,761
现在跑 sh docker-shell.sh
Now run sh docker-shell.sh.

141
00:08:06,081 --> 00:08:09,815
横幅显示区域和 bucket，身份检查失败了
The banner shows region and bucket, and the who am I check fails.

142
00:08:10,135 --> 00:08:14,231
额外检查：现在是 SageMaker 版本 2，而且没有 docker 命令
Extras: SageMaker version 2 now, and no docker command.

143
00:08:14,551 --> 00:08:18,220
Docker 的 socket 挂进来了，但里面没有 docker 程序
The socket is mounted, but no docker program is inside.

144
00:08:18,466 --> 00:08:22,946
从这里开始，SDK 就是你的遥控器，课上就是这么说的
From here, the SDK is your remote control, as the lecture puts it.

145
00:08:23,266 --> 00:08:26,466
你的 Python 发出请求，AWS 的机器去跑
Your Python asks, and AWS machines run.

146
00:08:26,833 --> 00:08:30,908
第 2 步：带上 data collector 参数，跑 python cli.py
Step 2: python cli.py --data_collector.

147
00:08:31,228 --> 00:08:32,668
它停在第 32 行
It stops at line 32,

148
00:08:32,668 --> 00:08:37,777
