149
00:08:38,097 --> 00:08:42,129
这个 CLI 的每个参数，在导入时都需要一个能用的密钥
Every flag of this CLI needs a working key at import time.

150
00:08:42,366 --> 00:08:44,957
有密钥时，它建一个 processor
With keys, it builds a processor

151
00:08:44,957 --> 00:08:48,275
用你 ECR 里的 image，跑在一台 ml.t3.medium 上
from your ECR image, on one ml.t3.medium.

152
00:08:48,595 --> 00:08:52,947
它的 entrypoint 是 python3 加上采集器的 cli.py
Its entry point is python3 with the collector cli.py.

153
00:08:53,267 --> 00:08:57,833
然后带着搜索参数运行这个任务，一边等一边显示日志
Then it runs the job with the search arguments, and waits, showing the logs.

154
00:08:58,100 --> 00:08:59,700
这就是生产模式
This is production mode.

155
00:08:59,871 --> 00:09:03,540
SageMaker 在参数前面放上它自己的命令
SageMaker puts its own command in front of the arguments.

156
00:09:03,860 --> 00:09:05,863
同一个 image，同一个 cli.py
Same image, same cli.py,

157
00:09:05,863 --> 00:09:08,617
跑在一台你从来不用登录的机器上
on a machine you never log in to.

158
00:09:08,937 --> 00:09:11,561
这个任务以角色的身份运行，用的不是你的密钥
The job acts as the role, not with your key.

159
00:09:12,783 --> 00:09:16,559
第 3 步：在 Processing 下面的 Processing jobs 里看
Step 3: watch it under Processing, then Processing jobs.

160
00:09:18,533 --> 00:09:20,133
现在看整条 pipeline
Now the whole pipeline.

161
00:09:20,346 --> 00:09:23,710
课件用 Kubeflow 的 DSL 写步骤
The slides write steps in the Kubeflow DSL,

162
00:09:23,710 --> 00:09:26,682
用 .output 连起来，再编译成 YAML
wired by .output and compiled to YAML.

163
00:09:27,002 --> 00:09:31,312
这里是 SageMaker 的步骤类、属性引用和 JSON
Here: SageMaker step classes, property references and JSON.

164
00:09:32,250 --> 00:09:34,383
首先是缓存，30 天
First, caching, for 30 days.

165
00:09:34,703 --> 00:09:38,445
第一步是一个叫 DataCollector 的处理步骤
The first step is a processing step named DataCollector,

166
00:09:38,445 --> 00:09:40,783
声明了一个输出：raw-data
with one declared output, raw-data.

167
00:09:41,033 --> 00:09:46,470
第二步是数据处理器，它的输入是采集器的一个属性
The second step, the processor, takes as input a property of the collector:

168
00:09:46,470 --> 00:09:48,500
它的 raw-data 输出的 S3 URI
its raw-data output, S3 URI.

169
00:09:48,820 --> 00:09:51,636
不是字符串，而是一个引用，它画出一条边
Not a string: a reference, and it draws an edge.

170
00:09:52,400 --> 00:09:56,660
训练用同样的方式拿处理器的 TFRecords 输出
Training takes the TFRecords output of the processor the same way,

171
00:09:56,660 --> 00:10:00,080
模型步骤拿训练出来的模型产物
and the model step takes the trained model artifacts.

172
00:10:00,400 --> 00:10:02,554
每个引用都多画出一条边
Each reference draws one more edge.

173
00:10:02,800 --> 00:10:08,005
最后，Lambda 步骤 DeployModel，从模型步骤拿模型名
Last, the Lambda step named DeployModel takes the model name from the model step.

174
00:10:08,325 --> 00:10:10,870
然后这个 pipeline 列出全部五个步骤
Then the pipeline lists all five steps,

175
00:10:10,870 --> 00:10:13,675
从你的笔记本创建负责部署的 Lambda
creates the deploy Lambda from your laptop,

176
00:10:13,675 --> 00:10:16,154
upsert 它的定义，再启动它
upserts its definition, and starts it.

177
00:10:16,950 --> 00:10:18,550
想一想
Something to ponder.

178
00:10:18,614 --> 00:10:21,174
把 Pipeline 调用里的步骤列表倒过来
Reverse the list of steps in the Pipeline call.

179
00:10:21,494 --> 00:10:23,094
运行顺序会变吗？
Does the run order change?

180
00:10:31,833 --> 00:10:37,764
不会。顺序来自引用：每个输入都指向另一个步骤的输出
No. The order comes from the references: each input names the output of another step.

181
00:10:38,084 --> 00:10:40,750
这个列表是一组步骤，不是一份时间表
The list is a set of steps, not a schedule.

182
00:10:41,000 --> 00:10:46,568
额外看一样东西，离线生成、从没发出去：SDK 生成的 JSON 定义
An extra, built offline and never sent: the JSON definition from the SDK.

183
00:10:46,888 --> 00:10:50,280
五个步骤，每条边都是一次 Get，取另一个步骤的某个属性
Five steps, each edge a get on a property of another step.

184
00:10:50,600 --> 00:10:52,200
Upsert 发送的就是它
Upsert sends this.

185
00:10:53,100 --> 00:10:54,871
课上画的是四个步骤
The lecture draws four steps.

186
00:10:55,191 --> 00:10:57,047
在这里，部署拆成了两步
Here, deploy splits in two.

187
00:10:57,367 --> 00:10:59,566
CreateModel 创建模型
CreateModel makes the model,

188
00:10:59,566 --> 00:11:02,629
而一个 Lambda，也就是 AWS 按需运行的小函数
and a Lambda, a small function AWS runs

189
00:11:02,629 --> 00:11:06,006
负责创建或更新 endpoint
on demand, creates or updates the endpoint.

190
00:11:07,250 --> 00:11:08,850
如实说明一点
One honest caveat.

191
00:11:08,999 --> 00:11:14,608
边决定顺序，但文件也会按固定的名字经过 bucket 传递
The edges set the order, but files also travel by fixed names through the bucket:

192
00:11:14,608 --> 00:11:17,170
raw.zip、clean.zip 和 tfrecords.zip
raw.zip, clean.zip and tfrecords.zip.

193
00:11:17,490 --> 00:11:19,939
没有账号，我们没法检查
We could not check, without an account,

194
00:11:19,939 --> 00:11:23,015
训练任务是怎么在 SageMaker 上找到它的数据的
how the training job finds its data on SageMaker.

195
00:11:23,250 --> 00:11:29,437
第 1 步：python cli.py --pipeline 停在同样的第 32 行
Step 1: python cli.py --pipeline stops at the same line 32.

196
00:11:29,757 --> 00:11:32,509
有密钥时，它会打印 pipeline 已经启动
With keys, it prints that the pipeline started.

197
00:11:32,829 --> 00:11:37,157
如果 upsert 反而因为 Lambda 的运行时失败
If instead upsert fails on the Lambda runtime,

198
00:11:37,157 --> 00:11:42,237
就在 Lambda 调用里把运行时设为 python 3.12，在第 297 行
add runtime="python3.12" to the Lambda call, line 297.

199
00:11:42,557 --> 00:11:44,385
第 2 步：在 Unified Studio 里
Step 2: in Unified Studio,

200
00:11:44,385 --> 00:11:48,039
Build 下面的 ML Pipelines，你会看到这张图
under Build, ML Pipelines, you would see this graph.

201
00:11:48,283 --> 00:11:52,632
如果每一步都成功，缓存会在 30 天内跳过没变的步骤
If every step succeeds, caching skips unchanged steps for 30 days,

202
00:11:52,632 --> 00:11:55,003
所以采集器不会再抓取一遍
so the collector won't scrape again.

203
00:11:55,323 --> 00:11:58,972
而且绿色的 DeployModel 只说明 Lambda 发出了请求
And a green DeployModel only means the Lambda asked:

204
00:11:58,972 --> 00:12:01,638
要等到 endpoint 进入服务状态
wait until the endpoint is in service.

205
00:12:01,883 --> 00:12:05,062
第 3 步用各自的参数分别测试每个组件
Step 3 tests each component with its own flag.

206
00:12:05,382 --> 00:12:07,579
在这里，四个都停在那一行
Here, all four stop at that line.

207
00:12:07,899 --> 00:12:11,078
有密钥时，模型部署又会建一个新的 endpoint
With keys, model deploy makes yet another endpoint.

208
00:12:12,417 --> 00:12:14,017
走之前，先收尾清理
Before you leave, clean up.

209
00:12:14,337 --> 00:12:17,022
列出你的 endpoint，全部删掉
List your endpoints and delete every one:

210
00:12:17,022 --> 00:12:20,822
第 1 部分那些带时间戳的，还有 cheese-app-endpoint
the timestamped ones from part 1, and cheese-app-endpoint.

211
00:12:21,142 --> 00:12:23,937
然后删掉它们的配置和模型
Then delete their configurations and models.

212
00:12:24,184 --> 00:12:26,189
清空并删除两个 bucket
Empty and delete both buckets.

213
00:12:26,509 --> 00:12:30,872
删除两个 ECR 仓库、负责部署的 Lambda 函数
Delete the two ECR repositories, the deploy Lambda functions,

214
00:12:30,872 --> 00:12:32,589
还有 cheese 的 pipeline
and the cheese pipeline.

215
00:12:32,834 --> 00:12:38,082
停用并删除访问密钥，还有不再需要的用户和角色
Deactivate and delete the access keys, and the users and roles you no longer need.

216
00:12:38,402 --> 00:12:41,168
最后，检查你创建的两个域
Finally, check the SageMaker AI domain

217
00:12:41,168 --> 00:12:44,226
SageMaker AI 域和 Unified Studio 域
and the Unified Studio domain you created.

218
00:12:47,067 --> 00:12:50,974
课上最后讲的是一座工厂：你的 Python 是配方
The lecture ends on a factory: your Python is the recipe,

219
00:12:50,974 --> 00:12:53,168
SageMaker Pipelines 来运行它
and SageMaker Pipelines runs it.

220
00:12:53,488 --> 00:12:57,478
今天的几幅图：笔记本上的一把密钥，云端的一个角色
Today's pictures: a key on the laptop and a role in the cloud.

221
00:12:57,798 --> 00:12:59,398
星号不是 pin
A star is not a pin.

222
00:12:59,590 --> 00:13:02,619
预处理放在客户端，或者放在模型里
Preprocessing sits in the client or in the model.

223
00:13:02,939 --> 00:13:07,440
站在 endpoint 背后的是三样东西，而引用画出了边
Three pieces stand behind an endpoint, and references draw the edges.

224
00:13:07,684 --> 00:13:09,967
在它下面，是用四条命令走完的第 1 部分
Under it, part 1 in four commands.

225
00:13:10,287 --> 00:13:15,215
其中 prepare 打包模型，deploy 建出模型、配置和 endpoint
Prepare packs the model, deploy builds the model, configuration and endpoint.

226
00:13:15,535 --> 00:13:18,884
而 predict 发送那些数字，delete 关掉计价器
Predict sends the numbers, and delete turns off the meter.

227
00:13:19,134 --> 00:13:20,513
自测一下
Test yourself.

228
00:13:20,563 --> 00:13:25,811
你的笔记本和 endpoint 都会访问 S3：各自用的是哪个身份？
Your laptop and the endpoint both reach S3: which identity does each use?

229
00:13:26,131 --> 00:13:30,206
为什么选项 2 的 export，永远到不了第 1 部分的 container？
And why do the option 2 exports never reach the part 1 container?

230
00:13:30,450 --> 00:13:32,605
说出 deploy 创建的三样东西
Name the three things deploy creates.

231
00:13:32,925 --> 00:13:36,786
哪一个是地址，哪一个在没人调用时也在计费？
Which one is the address, and which one bills while nobody calls it?

232
00:13:37,106 --> 00:13:39,508
预处理在第 1 部分里放在哪里
Where does preprocessing sit in part 1,

233
00:13:39,508 --> 00:13:43,080
在第 2 部分的训练脚本里又放在哪里，为什么要挪进模型？
and in the part 2 trainer, and why move it into the model?

234
00:13:43,317 --> 00:13:45,984
哪几行让训练等着数据处理器？
Which lines make training wait for the processor?

235
00:13:46,304 --> 00:13:48,739
今天需要哪两处一行修复
Which two one-line fixes did today need,

236
00:13:48,739 --> 00:13:51,296
Apple Silicon 的 Mac 会跳过哪一处？
and which would an Apple silicon Mac skip?

237
00:13:51,616 --> 00:13:57,610
答案在练习里，第 23 讲会从 GitHub 触发这个 pipeline
The answers are in the exercises, and lecture 23 triggers the pipeline from GitHub.
